# Backend in Docker Only

The backend environment (Python, uv, etc.) exists only inside Docker. Do not run backend-related commands on the host.

**Run commands inside the container:**

- **Interactive shell:**
  `docker compose -f compose.dev.yaml --progress quiet run --rm apiserver bash`

- **Single command:**
  `docker compose -f compose.dev.yaml --progress quiet run --rm apiserver <command>`

Example: to run `python -m pytest`, use:

`docker compose -f compose.dev.yaml --progress quiet run --rm apiserver bash -c "python -m pytest"`
